# Lets `dotmanager theme set` apply icon accent colors without a password
# prompt when it runs somewhere with no terminal attached (the rofi theme
# switcher's keybind, for instance) -- see core/theme_appliers/icon_theme.py.
#
# Scoped to exactly the commands that step runs: extracting a .tar already
# inside this repo's assets/icon-themes/, and rebuilding the icon cache for
# exactly Papirus-Dark/Papirus-Light. Doesn't grant anything a user who
# already owns this repo's files couldn't already do.
#
# Install with: sudo install -m 0440 assets/sudoers/dotmanager-theme /etc/sudoers.d/dotmanager-theme
# (then sudo visudo -c to verify it parses before trusting it)
#
# Adjust the username and repo path below if either differs from a fresh
# clone at ~/Projects/dotmanager.
gajeet ALL=(root) NOPASSWD: /usr/bin/tar -xf /home/gajeet/Projects/dotmanager/assets/icon-themes/*.tar -C /
gajeet ALL=(root) NOPASSWD: /usr/bin/gtk-update-icon-cache -qf /usr/share/icons/Papirus-Dark
gajeet ALL=(root) NOPASSWD: /usr/bin/gtk-update-icon-cache -qf /usr/share/icons/Papirus-Light
